{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3e1e43088dc4271a","name":"Micro Grenade Launcher","source":{"id":"source:reference-3e1e43088dc4271a","title":"Micro Grenade Launcher","revision":19711,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:28:14Z","sha256":"821f62035bf2e3e2a203fd0e6aaf24bb52c9f15a1358c9c8ce5899caab87533f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19711","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Micro%20Grenade%20Launcher&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3e1e43088dc4271a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Locris Syndicates MGL-1 Micro Grenade Launcher is a small, portable weapon that can deliver miniaturized ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenades","referenceId":"reference:0288f85b407ca487"}," quickly and with a minimal amount of training. Unlike other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade Launchers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade_Launchers"},", this weapon is classified as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," for the manner in which it is used. A Micro Grenade Launcher fires Micro Grenades, which act as normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenades","referenceId":"reference:0288f85b407ca487"}," but are somewhat smaller. Micro Grenades follow the all the normal rules for each type of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade"},", but deal -2 dice of damage on a successful hit.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Micro Grenade Launcher holds four Micro Grenades and has to be reloaded as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". A Micro Grenade Launcher can be mounted on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," (this takes 1 minute and requires a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check) or used as a separate weapon.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," Varies by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," Varies by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 3 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Varies by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Inaccurate:"]}," This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," Due to the nature of its ammunition, a Micro Grenade Launcher is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," weapon.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
